{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00409",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 4.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Doctor? Hi. I hope I've got the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.19,
      "end_seconds": 9.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.49,
      "end_seconds": 12.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "I've been dealing with acne."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.33,
      "end_seconds": 15.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.63,
      "end_seconds": 30.28,
      "duration_seconds": 13.65,
      "text": "For nearly five years, I'd say. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.45,
      "end_seconds": 35.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Right, how would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.46,
      "end_seconds": 37.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.21,
      "end_seconds": 40.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.21,
      "end_seconds": 43.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "It usually comes with oily skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.31,
      "end_seconds": 48.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.49,
      "end_seconds": 50.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.53,
      "end_seconds": 54.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Has there been dark marks after they heal too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.49,
      "end_seconds": 60.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Yes, I have. With dark marks after they heal, severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.86,
      "end_seconds": 65.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Right, any excess hair growth, pregnancy or new face cream at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.86,
      "end_seconds": 70.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "No, no excess hair growth, pregnancy or new face cream."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.61,
      "end_seconds": 75.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.39,
      "end_seconds": 87.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.08,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.11,
      "end_seconds": 90.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.59,
      "end_seconds": 92.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.93,
      "end_seconds": 95.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.45,
      "end_seconds": 102.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.02,
      "end_seconds": 110.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Okay, what about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.46,
      "end_seconds": 113.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Right, I've had acid reflux, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.45,
      "end_seconds": 117.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.15,
      "end_seconds": 121.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I'm on omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.27,
      "end_seconds": 122.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.62,
      "end_seconds": 129.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "It's face wash, twice a day. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.04,
      "end_seconds": 133.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.86,
      "end_seconds": 135.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "About about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.35,
      "end_seconds": 137.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.13,
      "end_seconds": 141.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.81,
      "end_seconds": 143.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.22,
      "end_seconds": 147.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.06,
      "end_seconds": 153.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.46,
      "end_seconds": 156.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.19,
      "end_seconds": 161.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.24,
      "end_seconds": 170.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.57,
      "end_seconds": 196.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, heart rate 69. And temperature is 36.5 degrees, respiratory rate 17, blood pressure 108 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.81,
      "end_seconds": 199.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.9,
      "end_seconds": 202.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.05,
      "end_seconds": 208.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.13,
      "end_seconds": 211.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.17,
      "end_seconds": 232.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "There are red papules and a few pustules over the cheeks and chin, with some blackheads."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.19,
      "end_seconds": 262.54,
      "duration_seconds": 27.35,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.95,
      "end_seconds": 264.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.58,
      "end_seconds": 289.07,
      "duration_seconds": 20.49,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like moderate acne. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'd also keep rosacea in mind. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had acne for nearly five years, severe, and no excess hair growth or pregnancy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.39,
      "end_seconds": 290.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.66,
      "end_seconds": 295.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.79,
      "end_seconds": 300.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "No problem, you know, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.97,
      "end_seconds": 318.37,
      "duration_seconds": 17.4,
      "text": "I'd like you to take adapalene gel, at night, for eight weeks. It's for acne. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Don't squeeze them, that's how the marks stay. It takes six to eight weeks to see the difference, so please don't give up in the first fortnight."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.64,
      "end_seconds": 339.23,
      "duration_seconds": 20.59,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.06,
      "end_seconds": 340.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.92,
      "end_seconds": 345.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in eight weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.38,
      "end_seconds": 348.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.53,
      "end_seconds": 353.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.73,
      "end_seconds": 362.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "So, I take the adapalene gel, at night and come back in eight weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.58,
      "end_seconds": 367.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.79,
      "end_seconds": 370.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    }
  ]
}